.TH HOODMIN-CREATE-OWNER 8 "2026-10-18" "Hoodmin 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
hoodmin-create-owner \- create the first Hoodmin owner
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hoodmin-create-owner EMAIL HTTPS_ORIGIN
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run as root on a fresh database. Generates a random password and writes it only to /root/hoodmin-first-owner.json with mode 0600. Does not repeat if an account already exists. Set up trusted HTTPS before using the panel.
.SH SEE ALSO
/usr/share/doc/hoodmin/docs/uretim-kurulumu.md
